+          From dim_league.league_logo_url. NULL for a competition with no crest ingested (#36's
+          gap) or never ingested at all.
+      - name: region_label_en
+        description: >
+          The competition's country if it has one (league_country), else its region's English
+          label (confederation's label_en). Resolves the country-vs-region branch (#69 step 5) —
+          never both, never neither, because every registry row's confederation is FK-guaranteed
+          to resolve.
+        tests: [not_null]
+      - name: region_label_i18n_key
+        description: >
+          The region's i18n key, or NULL when region_label_en is a country name — a country name
+          is an entity name, not chrome (#62, 2026-08-14).
+      - name: next_kickoff_datetime
+        description: "Earliest upcoming fixture kickoff for this league_code. NULL when nothing is scheduled."
+      - name: last_kickoff_datetime
+        description: "Most recent past fixture kickoff for this league_code. NULL when nothing has ever been played."
+
